  "title": "Free Tool That Stops Claude From Wasting Your Budget",
  "description": "Claude Code re-reads your entire project every session, and that's what burns your tokens. This free tool builds a map of your codebase one time so Claude jumps straight to the code it needs, cutting token use 30 to 60% and stretching your plan a lot further. It runs locally, so your code never leaves your machine. Full setup below.\n\nGet the free setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-XevuIJjun52iyCVPEWLzuOxuoFThNRnaJE_5SVbJlI/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeCode #AITools",
